<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daewoo Elec builds fridge plant in Spain.</title>
<headline>Daewoo Elec builds fridge plant in Spain.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daewoo Electronics Co Ltd, a unit of South Korea's Daewoo Group, said on Tuesday it has started construction of an $87-million refrigerator plant in Spain.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the plant would initially have an annual production capacity for 50,000 units. The annual output is expected to increase to 150,000 by 1998, 300,000 by 1999, 450,000 by 2000 and 600,000 by 2001, it added.</p>
<p>It said the plant was scheduled to start operating in 1997, but did not elaborate.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
